,"canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10369","name":"佐々木 詩織","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:130611","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"黒木 ノア","creatorId":"vndb:s10981","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10981","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10981","name":"黒木 ノア","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:130619","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"VII","creatorId":"vndb:s10982","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10982","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10982","name":"VII","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:130620","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"亜佐美 晶","creatorId":"vndb:s10983","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10983","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10983","name":"亜佐美 晶","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:130621","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"星本美結","creatorId":"vndb:s11291","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11291","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11291","name":"星本美結","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:130622","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"つゑふ","creatorId":"vndb:s23462","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23462","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23462","name":"つゑふ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:130623","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c46821","characterName":"華野 椎名","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"43495","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"181216"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10189"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46821"},"originalCharacterName":"華野 椎名","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Romantic Stance: Has given up on her love"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Emotion towards protagonist: Thinks \"he is like a dog\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Third year high school student. Protagonist's senpai. Student Council President, who is extremely popular and has mastered the \"carrot and stick\" policy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has outstanding feminity and efficient in working in fields. Loves children and is very good at taking care of others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In backlash of being brought up by a strict father, likes to do whatever she wants, in private."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Yes yes, you can play as much as you want later, but for the time being, stop doing such strange stuff.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46821"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"３年生。主人公の先輩。飴と鞭を使いこなす人望厚き生徒会長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネイルに料理に畑仕事と女子力抜群。子供好きで面倒見もいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳格な父に育てられた反動で、プライベートは自由を美徳に好きなことをして過ごしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10189","sourceWorkId":"23610","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛スタンス：自分の恋は諦めている"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公への感情：「犬みたい」と思っている"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"3年生。 主人公の先輩。 飴と鞭を使いこなす人望厚き生徒会長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネイルに料理に畑仕事と、女子力抜群。 子供好きで面倒見もいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳格な父に育てられた反動で、プライベートでは好きなことをして過ごしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「はいはい、後でいくらでも遊んであげるから、今はその変な芸やめて。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43495"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f92832c96fd9d2688b984ac73bc05b08bc0f3014ad8762b8b61a2375eea61a7a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0e8bf5506ac6a896b7513c03095e80c958050bc3b4e93839528e87b81dda63c.webp","width":64,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"近藤祐記","creatorId":"vndb:s1412","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1412","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1412","name":"近藤 祐記","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:181216:43495:5904:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c46822","characterName":"如月 のえ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"43496","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"181216"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10190"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46822"},"originalCharacterName":"如月 のえ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Romantic Stance: After coming to like someone, cannot hold back her feelings"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Emotion towards protagonist: Thinks \"Is every guy in city like this..?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Second year high school student. Girl in liberal arts, who loves reading and insects, above all else."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Besides helping in the inn where the protagonist resides, spends most of her free time on her hobbies."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Personality is mostly about doing things at her own pace. Has communication ability and despite being modest, has strong curiosity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"If I come to like a person, I am sure I won't be able to confess by myself.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46822"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"２年生。読書と昆虫をこよなく愛する文系の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の住む民宿を手伝う傍ら、普段は自分の趣味に時間を割いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は至ってマイペース。コミュ力はあるので、控えめなところはあっても好奇心は強い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10190","sourceWorkId":"23610","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛スタンス：好きになったら、自分の気持ちを抑えられない"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公への感情：「都会の男子ってみんなこうなの…？」と思っている"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"2年生。 読書と昆虫をこよなく愛する文系の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の住む民宿を手伝う傍ら、普段は自分の趣味に時間を割いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はいたってマイペース。 コミュ力はあり、控えめでありながらも好奇心は強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私、好きな人ができても、きっと自分から告白なんて出来ないと思います。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43496"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/52f2b748b535f1bcbf20c9867822e96ab45708cc12c10ef9c7a09157003402b8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f3dcfbbb0a4e770fda0dda6be403b19f0ed699d5fbcd81b58dd23b7bc81cfafb.webp","width":80,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本理絵","creatorId":"vndb:s874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s874","name":"岡本 理絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:181216:43496:13368:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c46823","characterName":"柳 明日香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"43497","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"181216"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10191"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46823"},"originalCharacterName":"柳 明日香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Romantic Stance: If falls in love, is easy to be stained in the colour of her lover."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Emotion towards protagonist: Thinks \"Why is he lecturing me only !?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Belongs to the rhythmic gymnastics club. Is always bright, energetic and a mood maker."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Possesses extraordinary reflexes. Due to this straightforward personality, is popular regardless of gender."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, is very ignorant regarding matters of love. There's not even a single romantic story."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On one surface is a friendly and shy person. From childhood has stuck and been pampered by her grandmother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Boyfriend? Having one would be a miracle! Because I am like this\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46823"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子新体操部に所属。いつも明るく元気なムードメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人並み外れた運動神経を持ち、その真っ直ぐな性格から性別問わず人気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし色恋沙汰には非常に疎く、浮いた話が一つもない。人懐っこく照れ屋な一面もあり、子供の頃は祖母にべったりな甘えん坊だったらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10191","sourceWorkId":"23610","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛スタンス：恋をしたら相手の色に染まりやすい"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公への感情：「なんで私だけに説教するの !?」と思っている"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子新体操部に所属。 いつも明るく元気なムードメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人並み外れた運動神経を持ち、その真っ直ぐな性格から性別問わず人気がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし色恋沙汰には非常に疎く、浮いた話が一つもない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人懐っこく照れ屋な一面もあり、子供の頃は祖母にべったりな甘えん坊だったらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「彼氏？　私にそんなのできたら奇跡でしょ！　だって私こんなんだよ。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43497"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db943cec97bc26f48cf235c4e89d4f193a95030399c2e0a79fe76df6e12b0708.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3ca517fda4117b9d3460d552ca3a70173592ce42fa0133a0ca4c45cb6116ab19.webp","width":71,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木住葵","creatorId":"vndb:s8350","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8350","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8350","name":"木住 葵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:181216:43497:60181:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c46824","characterName":"芹沢 久遠","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"43498","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"181216"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10192"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46824"},"originalCharacterName":"芹沢 久遠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Romantic Stance: Expresses her feelings directly"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Emotion towards protagonist: Thinks \"He shares similar features with me\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"First year high school student, who was brought up at a wealthy household. Moved to Shirasagi town, 1 month earlier than the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Is quick witted and also has excellent grades. Although has talent in creation of art, is lacking in cooking and also bad with insects."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tackles everything with confidence. Is not hesitant in approaching anyone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I like it. The innocent part of you, is cute..\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46824"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"裕福な家庭で暮らしている、年下の新入生。主人公より１ヶ月早く白鷺町に引っ越してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭の回転が速く成績も非常に優秀。創作、芸術の才能があるが、料理はできず虫も苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事にも自信を持って取り組み、誰の前でも臆することなく接している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10192","sourceWorkId":"23610","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛スタンス：気持ちをストレートにぶつける"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公への感情：「自分と似たところがある」と思っている"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"裕福な家庭で育った年下の新入生。 主人公より 1ヵ月早く白鷺町に引っ越してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭の回転が速く成績優秀。 創作・芸術の才能はあるが料理はイマイチで、虫が苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事にも自信を持って取り組み、誰に対しても臆することなく接している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私は好き。 あなたのそういう無邪気なところ、可愛いもの――」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43498"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bfb917550d1b91f2d3b701250345aba6b7d7a4537845a4a6c2d01094d64fb98a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/